e":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1557711274,"text":"(When I passed through the wall of light, it felt like my whole body was frozen.)","nextNodeIds":[50220702]},{"nodeId":50220702,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2445144490,"text":"(I guess the Lord of the Night's protection can't reach this place. The cold and darkness are suffocating, and all I hear are cries of exhaustion and pain.)","nextNodeIds":[50220703]},{"nodeId":50220703,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2900468946,"text":"(How long have these souls existed in torment? How much longer before it ends...?)","nextNodeIds":[50220704]},{"nodeId":50220704,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1575027882,"text":"(Huh? There's someone here...)","nextNodeIds":[50220705]},{"nodeId":50220705,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14235,"speakerName":"\"The Captain\"","textMapHash":2877925610,"text":"Though our homeland has become a distant memory, the flames of war continue to rage. We have long shed the last of our blood...","nextNodeIds":[50220706]},{"nodeId":50220706,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14235,"speakerName":"\"The Captain\"","textMapHash":2836583658,"text":"Stay strong, my soldiers...","nextNodeIds":[50220707]},{"nodeId":50220707,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3144591194,"text":"(What is The Captain doing here? And what is he saying...?)","nextNodeIds":[50220708]},{"nodeId":50220708,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14235,"speakerName":"\"The Captain\"","textMapHash":2304667090,"text":"One day, I will deliver you to the place I promised.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[502207,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[0,0],"P